hbmzz.video_screen.tip1=Right-click: a television in the middle of the screen (F for fullscreen, F again for the window)
hbmzz.video_screen.tip2=Shift + right-click: menu (seek bar, +/-5s, +/-30s, pause, rewind, size)
hbmzz.video_screen.tip3=To connect it: right-click the player with the remote, then this wall
hbmzz.video_screen.tip4=Play and stop are the redstone lever on the player; the clip is read from each client's config/hbmzz/videos
item.hbmzz.video_remote.name=Screen Remote
