item.hbmzz.ctrl_console.name=Machine Control Console
hbmzz.console.desc=Right-click with the monitor link cable to open the layout editor.
hbmzz.console.desc2=Right-click bare-handed to press a control; the panel can drive redstone.
hbmzz.console.desc3=Controls, events, variables and node logic ported from NTM: Cursed Edition.
