item.hbmzz.hacker_tablet.name=Hacker Tablet
hbmzz.tablet.desc=Right-click to open the terminal.
hbmzz.tablet.desc2=Type "target x y z" to lock a machine, then "set field value".
hbmzz.tablet.desc3=Writes fields directly, bypassing the control rods.
hbmzz.linker.desc=Right-click a power meter, DFC core or monitoring camera to record it.
hbmzz.linker.desc2=Then right-click the monitor to bind. A camera switches it to page 4.
hbmzz.linker.desc3=Record a machine, then right-click a panel to open it, or sneak-right-click to drop it into a free slot.
