hbmzz.msg.camera_bound=Camera %s bound to the terminal, switched to page 4. Sneak-right-click to disconnect.
hbmzz.msg.camera_lost=The recorded camera is gone. Record it again.
hbmzz.msg.camera_far=That camera is too far (%s blocks).
hbmzz.msg.camera_clear=Camera disconnected. The screen is back on the data pages.
hbmzz.camera.info=Camera %s | channel %s | aim %s. Right-click with the monitor link cable to put it on a screen.
